# 8:1 is "and when the seventh month came, the children of Israel were in
# their cities", the end of KJV 7:73 (Hebrew 7:72), so 8:2 is "And all the
# people gathered themselves together as one man" (8:1). Chapter 7 is
# numbered as in English, horses and mules (7:68) included; it's listed so
# that it and 8:1 map onto Hebrew 7:72 under one system.
NEH 7:1-68 = NEH 7:1-68
NEH 7:69-73 = NEH 7:68-72
NEH 8:1 = NEH 7:72
NEH 8:2-19 = NEH 8:1-18
